Spec: Windows development Broker

Purpose:
  Host explicit per-user declaration review and optional authenticated, service-authorized direct streams.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Broker.csproj
  ./README.md
  ./packages.lock.json

References:
  ./PipeHost.sdd
  ./ControlProtocol.sdd
  ./FrameCodec.sdd
  /contracts/dotnet/LinkGate.Control/LinkGate.Control.sdd
  ./RegistrationStore.sdd
  ./CallerIdentity.sdd
  ./RegistrationReview.sdd
  ./JournalCapacity.sdd
  ./PendingGrants.sdd
  ./SecureIdentity.sdd
  ./SecureAuthority.sdd
  ./SecureConnections.sdd
  ./SecurePeerServer.sdd

Must not:
  Return configuration, caller paths, SID, credentials or another caller's application/service lists.
  Claim same-user malicious-process isolation or trust in a Broker discovered only by pipe name or PID.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Verify native pipe ownership, strict negotiation and bounded disconnect recovery.
  [x] #2 Verify a client pins the trusted launcher process before sending any control bytes.
  [x] #3 Verify durable pending registration without automatic authorization.

Done when:
  Isolated pipe tests cover fragmented frames, invalid inputs, occupied names, cancellation and subsequent clients.
